Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: freifunk-jena-wireguard-onboarder
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), wireguard-tools
Description: WireGuard peer onboarder for Freifunk Jena LibreMesh nodes
 HTTP service that accepts LibreMesh node WireGuard public keys and node
 IPs for the innercity VPN, allocates a WAN tunnel address, upserts peers
 into both /etc/wireguard configs, and removes stale peers via a handshake
 watchdog. No authentication; protect with firewall and rate limits.
